      },
      "weakest_link": "The premise that the Law's unkeepability was necessary for understanding the Judge paying the debt -- asserted, not argued, and it presupposes the atonement logic it is meant to explain.",
      "develop_next": "Show from the biblical text that the failure-experience is presented as the intended pedagogical mechanism, not a retrospective reading.",
      "case_map": ["K15"],
      "domain": "theology"
    },
